<%- model_class = Course -%>
<div class="page-header">
  <%= page_title("New Training Catalogue Entry") %>
</div>
<div class="row">
  <div class="col-md-4 col-md-push-8">
    <div class="info-box mb-4 p-3 border rounded bg-light">
      <div class="info-box-header mb-2">
        <i class="glyphicon glyphicon-info-sign text-primary mr-1"></i>
        Add an entry to the SciLifeLab catalogue
      </div>

      <p>
        The SciLifeLab training catalogue is a listing of all SciLifeLab-affiliated training. By adding an entry, potential participants can be alerted when the next registration cycle opens, and resources can be efficiently directed into developing training that target gaps in our national catalogue.
      </p>

      <p>
        To add a catalogue entry, fill in the form, including all required fields, with as rich information as you can!
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="col-md-8 col-md-pull-4">
    <%= render partial: 'form' %>
  </div>
</div>
